<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f5f5f5;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .header {
        background: #0b2343;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header h1 {
        color: #ffffff;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
      }
      .header p {
        color: #94a3b8;
        margin: 6px 0 0;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .body {
        padding: 30px;
      }
      .body p {
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #ff7c22;
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 8px 0;
      }
      .panel {
        background: #fafbfc;
        border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 18px;
        margin: 18px 0;
      }
      .panel strong {
        color: #0b2343;
      }
      .cta {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #ff7c22;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        margin: 12px 0;
      }
      .footer {
        background: #fafbfc;
        padding: 18px 30px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>You're approved to teach ESOL on Amber Training</h1>
        <p>Welcome to the ESOL teaching pool</p>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <p>Hi {{teacherName}},</p>

        <p>
          Your application to teach ESOL on the Amber Training platform has been
          approved. Your DBS check has been verified and your qualification ({{qualificationType}})
          has been recorded.
        </p>

        <span class="badge">Status: Approved</span>

        <div class="panel">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
            <strong>What this means</strong>
          </p>
          <p style="margin: 0;">
            You will now appear in the matching pool for ESOL learners in their
            organisations. When a learner is matched to you, you will receive a
            booking notification and email here.
          </p>
        </div>

        {{#if notes}}
          <div class="panel">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;"><strong>Notes from the admin team</strong></p>
            <p style="margin: 0;">{{notes}}</p>
          </div>
        {{/if}}

        <p>
          You can update your qualifications and availability any time from your
          dashboard.
        </p>

        <p style="text-align: center;">
          <a class="cta" href="{{dashboardUrl}}">Open your dashboard</a>
        </p>

        <p>
          If anything looks wrong on your record (qualification, DBS expiry,
          name), reply to this email and we'll fix it.
        </p>

        <p>— The Amber Training team</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        Amber Training Ltd · ambertraining.co.uk<br />
        &copy;
        {{currentYear}}
        Amber Training Ltd. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>